  "title": "Corn Dog Bites",
  "description": "Everyone from the kids on up to the grandparents will enjoy these cute little mini corn muffins filled with chunky pieces of hot dog. They have a corn dog flavor, but there's no frying involved - these bake up in the oven in just a few minutes.",
